### REST Client API 测试文件
### 使用 VS Code 的 REST Client 插件运行

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@token = your_access_token_here

### ==================== 健康检查 ====================

### 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ==================== 认证相关 ====================

### 用户注册
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "password123",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 用户登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ==================== 用户相关 ====================

### 获取用户信息
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 更新用户信息
PUT {{baseUrl}}/user/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "新昵称",
  "bio": "这是我的个人简介",
  "gender": 1
}

### 修改密码
PUT {{baseUrl}}/user/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_password": "password123",
  "new_password": "newpassword456"
}

### ==================== AI 聊天 ====================

### 创建聊天会话
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/chat/session
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "我的第一次对话"
}

### 发送聊天消息
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/chat/message
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "session-uuid-here",
  "content": "你好，我今天心情不太好"
}

### 获取聊天会话列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/chat/sessions?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取会话消息列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/chat/messages/session-uuid-here?page=1&page_size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==================== 鼓励卡片 ====================

### 获取今日鼓励卡片
GET {{baseUrl}}/content/encourage/today
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取鼓励卡片列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/content/encourage/list?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==================== 哲理命题 ====================

### 获取今日哲理命题
GET {{baseUrl}}/content/philosophy/today
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取哲理命题列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/content/philosophy/list?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==================== 写作交流 ====================

### 创建写作作品
POST {{baseUrl}}/writing/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "致青春的一封信",
  "content": "亲爱的青春，感谢你赋予我勇气和梦想...",
  "category": "prose",
  "tags": ["青春", "回忆", "成长"]
}

### 获取写作作品列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/writing/list?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 点赞作品
POST {{baseUrl}}/writing/like/work-uuid-here
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 创建评论
POST {{baseUrl}}/writing/comment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "work_id": "work-uuid-here",
  "content": "写得真好！"
}

### ==================== 记账 ====================

### 创建记账记录
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "record_type": "expense",
  "amount": 5000,
  "category": "餐饮",
  "description": "午餐",
  "date": "2024-01-15"
}

### 获取记账记录列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/list?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取统计信息
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/statistics?start_date=2024-01-01&end_date=2024-01-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==================== 便签 ====================

### 创建便签
POST {{baseUrl}}/note/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "今日待办",
  "content": "1. 完成项目文档\n2. 给妈妈打电话\n3. 运动30分钟",
  "color": "#FFE4B5",
  "is_pinned": false
}

### 获取便签列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/note/list?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 更新便签
PUT {{baseUrl}}/note/update/note-uuid-here
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "今日待办（已更新）",
  "content": "1. ✅ 完成项目文档\n2. 给妈妈打电话\n3. 运动30分钟",
  "is_pinned": true
}

### 删除便签
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/note/delete/note-uuid-here
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

